<title>UK: Alphameric to supply Coral Line in Ireland.</title>
<headline>Alphameric to supply Coral Line in Ireland.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alphameric Plc said on Tuesday it had won an order from betting shop group Coral for a new broadcast system to provide Coral Line information to its licensed betting outlets in Ireland.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the order was for the design, supply, installation and maintenance of Coral Line, a satellite delivered data broadcast network which already provides real time racing information to Coral's network of over 900 betting outlets across the UK.</p>
<p>It did not disclose any financial details.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
